SUMMARY:Christmas in Alsace
DESCRIPTION:Strasbourg's Christmas Market (Marché de Noël) runs from lat
 e November through December 24-31\, spread across a dozen squares in the 
 city center\, with Place Kléber's giant tree and Place de la Cathédrale
  as the anchor points.
